"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l007","ordinal":373179,"en":"If you rave, you madman,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l008","ordinal":373180,"en":"I will break your ribs."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l009","ordinal":373181,"en":"If you wriggle without cause,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l010","ordinal":373182,"en":"I will spill your blood like water."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l011","ordinal":373183,"en":"Whatever the hour may bring,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l012","ordinal":373184,"en":"You never cease your defiance."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l013","ordinal":373185,"en":"You fawning madman,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l014","ordinal":373186,"en":"You shameless swaggerer,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l015","ordinal":373187,"en":"Straining upon the spearpoint,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l016","ordinal":373188,"en":"You bristled in fury."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l017","ordinal":373189,"en":"I will bring your death upon you,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l018","ordinal":373190,"en":"Extinguish your burning soul,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l019","ordinal":373191,"en":"And send you from this world."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l020","ordinal":373192,"en":"I will strike you down in battle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l021","ordinal":373193,"en":"And settle the true account"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l022","ordinal":373194,"en":"Of this crackling fool."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l023","ordinal":373195,"en":"You dog of a wolf, Sarybai,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l024","ordinal":373196,"en":"Even a dog is far above you;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l025","ordinal":373197,"en":"Even a dog answers when called."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l026","ordinal":373198,"en":"You are a bird, Sarybai,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l027","ordinal":373199,"en":"Even a bird is far above you;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l028","ordinal":373200,"en":"Even a bird answers a whistle."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l029","ordinal":373201,"en":"You heed no spoken word,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l030","ordinal":373202,"en":"Nor do you go against distant foes."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l031","ordinal":373203,"en":"Brisling in fury,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l032","ordinal":373204,"en":"You never cease your defiance!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l033","ordinal":373205,"en":"So saying, Kuyaly"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l034","ordinal":373206,"en":"Gripped the tempered spear in her hand"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l035","ordinal":373207,"en":"And Sarybai upon its point"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l036","ordinal":373208,"en":"She shook and violently flung."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l037","ordinal":373209,"en":"Your sin is upon your own head,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l038","ordinal":373210,"en":"Your deeds fall upon your dark crown."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l039","ordinal":373211,"en":"The bare-shafted tempered spear"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b002:l040","ordinal":373212,"en":"She clutched firmly,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l001","ordinal":373213,"en":"While Sarybai hung above"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l002","ordinal":373214,"en":"And she swung him to and fro."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l003","ordinal":373215,"en":"Thus Sarybai"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l004","ordinal":373216,"en":"Was split in two upon the spear"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l005","ordinal":373217,"en":"And despaired of his wretched life."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l006","ordinal":373218,"en":"He lost all warrior courage;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l007","ordinal":373219,"en":"His shattered body was hurled,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l008","ordinal":373220,"en":"His backbone split in two,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l009","ordinal":373221,"en":"And jutting from the other side"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l010","ordinal":373222,"en":"The tempered spearpoint appeared."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l011","ordinal":373223,"en":"Kuyaly was truly adroit;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l012","ordinal":373224,"en":"She readied the tempered spear,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l013","ordinal":373225,"en":"Rent wide his dark liver,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l014","ordinal":373226,"en":"And split his heart in two."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l015","ordinal":373227,"en":"His liver was sliced like cheese,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l016","ordinal":373228,"en":"And the cur knew death had come."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l017","ordinal":373229,"en":"His courage fled, his strength was gone,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l018","ordinal":373230,"en":"And Sarybai’s blood poured out."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l019","ordinal":373231,"en":"His life departed with his strength;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l020","ordinal":373232,"en":"She stretched him upon the spearpoint,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l021","ordinal":373233,"en":"Overturned him and cast him down,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l022","ordinal":373234,"en":"And to the true abode whence none return"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l023","ordinal":373235,"en":"Sarybai had gone."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l024","ordinal":373236,"en":"At the hands of the maiden wrestler"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l025","ordinal":373237,"en":"The swine’s appointed death"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l026","ordinal":373238,"en":"Had come in just this way."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l027","ordinal":373239,"en":"Sarybai lay dead,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l028","ordinal":373240,"en":"Yet seemed as though the dead man"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l029","ordinal":373241,"en":"Might revive and rise again."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l030","ordinal":373242,"en":"They had clashed with thunderous blows,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l031","ordinal":373243,"en":"As though to begin the fight anew."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l032","ordinal":373244,"en":"It seemed the departed man"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l033","ordinal":373245,"en":"Might revive and rise again."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l034","ordinal":373246,"en":"As Sarybai lay dead,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l035","ordinal":373247,"en":"Drenched in crimson blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0993:b004:l036","ordinal":373248,"en":"They advanced in their turn"}]
